Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "HeavyRainWithOpenDoor" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2, :risk3, :risk4 .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Open door of a parked vehicle" .

:weather1 a :RainyCondition .

:risk1 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Visibility reduced due to heavy rain" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential collision with open door" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:risk3 a :RoadConditionRisk ;
    :description "Slippery road conditions due to rain" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev3 .

:risk4 a :DistractionRisk ;
    :description "Driver distraction due to heavy rain and potential debris" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev4 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.9"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.85"^^xsd:float .

:sev3 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:sev4 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.65"^^xsd:float .
```

